$\Gamma_S$ in $V_S$ (discrete subgroup of
rank $2$) and
\[
\boxed{\mathbb E\ell_0(\unsure{S})\unsure{\simeq|/2|=:}
X_S=V_S/\Gamma_S}.
\]

